 <span class=\"highlight\">stuns and damages</span> enemies within the radius.","descriptionRu":"Семь накладывает заряд на вражеского героя. После короткой задержки заряд <span class=\"highlight\">наносит урон и оглушает</span> врагов в радиусе действия.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"539192269","name":"Power Surge","nameRu":"Скачок напряжения","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/giga_chain.png","className":"ability_power_surge","description":"Power up your weapon with a shock effect, making <span class=\"highlight\">your bullets proc shock damage on your target</span>. This shock damage <span class=\"highlight\">bounces to enemies</span> near your target. Occurs once per burst shot.","descriptionRu":"Пули героя <span class=\"highlight\">наносят электрический урон цели</span>. Электрический заряд также отскакивает во <span class=\"highlight\">врагов, которые находятся рядом с целью</span>. Заряд выпускается раз за очередь.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2061574352","name":"Storm Cloud","nameRu":"Грозовое облако","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/giga_storm.png","className":"citadel_ability_storm_cloud","description":"Channel an expanding storm cloud around you that <span class=\"highlight\">damages all enemies</span> within its radius. Enemies do not take damage when they are out of line-of-sight.","descriptionRu":"Семь образует вокруг себя грозовое облако, которое <span class=\"highlight\">наносит урон всем врагам</span> в радиусе действия. Враги не получают урона, если находятся вне вашей видимости.","abilityType":"ultimate"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1443159618","name":"","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/icons/icon_speed.svg","className":"citadel_ability_sprint","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2207638101","name":"Dash","nameRu":"Рывок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_dash","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"664285540","name":"Parry","nameRu":"Парирование","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_melee_parry","description":"","abilityType":"innate"}],"updatedAt":"2026-11-15T20:33:16.440Z"}}